{"4327730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "洛希极限 Roche Limit", "steam_appid": 4327730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Roche Limit&quot; is a 2D pixel-art action game with a sci-fi mecha-girl theme. It blends high-speed aerial combat with ARPG strategic builds into a roguelite session structure. Choosing and playing as one of many mecha girls,  mastering your skills on the battlefield, and face uninvited threats from beyond the sky. Prevent the cataclysm, before the moon reaches the roche limit. Outside of combat, interact with the girls, delve into their inner worlds, and unlock more possibilities for combat builds.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Roche Limit&quot; is a 2D pixel-art action game with a sci-fi mecha-girl theme. It blends high-speed aerial combat with ARPG strategic builds into a roguelite session structure. Choosing and playing as one of many mecha girls,  mastering your skills on the battlefield, and face uninvited threats from beyond the sky. Prevent the cataclysm, before the moon reaches the roche limit. Outside of combat, interact with the girls, delve into their inner worlds, and unlock more possibilities for combat builds.</p>", "short_description": "​Roche Limit​ is a 2D pixel sci-fi action roguelite, blending high-speed aerial combat with ARPG builds. Choose a mecha-girl, build her skills on the battle, and face the cosmic legion. Between runs, bond with the girls for more skill possibles and stories. Prevent cataclysm before the moon falls.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327730/2f03846f90797ee2622bcebd9ba7c350746afe96/header.jpg?t=1769394845", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4327730/95e3578377889ba6abbaee957e5a61b70604e42f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769394845", "capsu